  "uprn": "200003992731",
  "decision_date": "06/02/2018",
  "description": "Variation of condition 3 to enable installation of additional mezzanine floor following planning permission 01499/C24/P1 dated 9/3/2000 for Change of use from B8 warehouse and distribution to B1(c) light industrial, construction of mezzanine floor, provision of roller shutter door, rubbish out door and screened bin area.",
  "site_name": "Unit 24",
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
  "decision_target_date": "06/02/2018",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": "TW5 9NR",
  "street_name": "Spitfire Way",
  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Other change of use",
  "lapsed_date": "05/02/2021",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of the original planning permission (namely 9th March 2000)",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (02, 03, 04,05, 07, 08, D001, Planning Statement (dated 11th December), WSP Transport Statement (Ref: 70041319) Received:12 December 2017 and 017_E Rev 1 Received:  13 January 2000) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The floor space of the unit shall not increase within the building by means of further internal horizontal division by more than the 844sqm mezzanine floor space hereby permitted without prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 4 - No industrial processing, packaging or storage activities (other than refuse storage and vehicle parking) shall take place anywhere on the site except within the building.",
    "Condition : 5 - The refuse storage arrangements shown on the approved drawing shall be completed before any part of the accommodation hereby permitted is occupied.",
    "Condition : 6 - Two disabled car parking spaces (2.4m wide by 4.8m long with a zone 1.2m wide provided between designated spaces and at the rear outside the traffic zone) shall be located near the main entrance of the building and within the curtilage of the site shall be provided prior to the first occupation of the hereby permitted mezzanine floor.",
    "Condition : 7 - Prior to first occupation of the hereby permitted mezzanine floor six secure, sheltered and accessible bicycle parking spaces shall be provided within the curtilage of the site and threafter retained as such",
    "Condition : 8 - The mezzanine hereby approved shall be used for B1c purposes and ancillary to the use of the building within which it would be located and for no other purposes (including any other purpose in Class B of the Schedule to the Town and Country Planning (Use Classes) Order 1987 or any other provision equivalent to that Class in any statutory instrument revoking and re-enacting that Order with or without modification)."
  ],
